          </div>
          <div class="tile w2 reveal d1">
            <div class="lab">Agent context <span class="soon">phase 5</span></div>
            <h3>Docs for agents, in the wheel</h3>
            <p>Locked to the installed version, so coding agents never read docs for a release you don't run.</p>
            <div class="viz">
              <pre class="tree" set:html={agentTree} />
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="tile w2 reveal d2">
            <div class="lab">Fake server <span class="soon">phase 5</span></div>
            <h3>Runs without a key</h3>
            <p>
              A testing module in every SDK returns spec-valid fixtures, so users and agents can try code with no API
              key and no network.
            </p>
            <div class="viz">
              <div class="report">
                <div><span>GET /current-time</span><b class="g">200 · spec-valid</b></div>
                <div><span>api key</span><b>not needed</b></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="tile w3 reveal">
            <div class="lab">GitHub Action</div>
            <h3>Keeps regenerating</h3>
